/* Cloud assistant — free daily limit reached (spec 27ced9b / c259dc64).
   Names the assistant (Auris) and the free daily allowance; no invented reset
   time. "try again tomorrow" is the approved template wording. */
"cloud_error_limit_exceeded" = "你已達到 Auris 嘅免費每日使用上限。請聽日再試。";

/* The conversation ended on the server, which is an ordinary end rather than a
   malfunction: say so plainly, and let the next request open a new conversation.
   Wording is shared with the other app so both say the same thing. */
"cloud_error_conversation_expired" = "嗰個對話已經結束咗。";

/* The answer did not come — the voice could not be produced, or the turn failed inside
   the assistant. To the listener these are one situation, so both codes speak this one
   sentence: an apology and a retry, with no system terms. Keep the two keys identical
   in every language; they are one line by decision, not two that may drift. */
"cloud_error_speech_unavailable" = "唔好意思，我啱啱答唔到你呢個問題。唔該再試一次。";
"cloud_error_internal_error" = "唔好意思，我啱啱答唔到你呢個問題。唔該再試一次。";

/* The connection dropped mid-turn. A plain statement of what happened and a retry,
   matching the other locales' tone; no mention of sockets or servers. */
"cloud_error_connection_lost" = "連線斷咗。唔該再試一次。";

/* No answer was found — a content outcome, not a malfunction: say so and invite a
   different phrasing rather than apologising for an outage. */
"cloud_error_no_answer" = "唔好意思，我搵唔到呢個問題嘅答案。唔該試吓用第二種問法。";

/* The evidence could not be fetched. The reason is not the user's, so name what
   failed in their terms and offer a retry. */
"cloud_error_retrieval_unavailable" = "唔好意思，我啱啱查唔到呢樣嘢。唔該再試一次。";

/* Audio arrived faster than it could be played, so the answer may be partial. To the
   listener this is an unfinished answer; the queue itself is never named. */
"cloud_error_queue_overflow" = "唔好意思，我答唔晒呢個問題。唔該再試一次。";

/* A shared deadline ran out (docs/specs/cloud-assistant.md#error-codes): the cause is TIME,
   not question length,
   so the line must not send the user after a shorter question. No reset time invented. */
"cloud_error_budget_exceeded" = "唔好意思，答咗太耐都答唔完。唔該再試一次。";

/* Another turn is still answering. Nothing failed, so no apology: say why and when to
   retry. */
"cloud_error_turn_conflict" = "我仲答緊你上一個問題。唔該等一陣再試一次。";

/* Prior context is unreadable. Report the loss and require a fresh conversation; a voice
   user starts one by ASKING AGAIN, since the client clears the handle
   (docs/specs/cloud-assistant.md#error-codes).
   Never mentions records or storage. */
"cloud_error_corrupt_record" = "唔好意思，我唔記得咗我哋傾到邊。唔該再問一次，咁就會開新嘅對話。";
